(a) the date, time and place of arrest;

(b) reasons for the arrest;

(c) the location of custody or detention;

(d) the name, identification number and rank of the arresting officer; and

(3) If such a person specified in subsection (1) is not present, the arresting officer shall inquire from the suspect, the identity and whereabouts of a person to whom the notification referred to in subsection (1) shall be served, and if the suspect provides such information, every possible step shall be taken to serve the notification on such person. A copy of the said notification shall be served on the suspect.

